# Production builds (`npm run build`) read this file AFTER `.env`, so it wins.
#
# The browser calls the API on the SAME origin that served the page: the reverse proxy
# (Nginx) serves `dist/` and forwards `/api/` to the Node process on 127.0.0.1:5000.
# Never put a host name here - a learner's browser resolves `localhost` to itself.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
